  "items": [
    {
      "source": "Annotation that can be applied to a test class to enable and configure\nauto-configuration of a single <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/test/web/client/MockRestServiceServer.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.test.web.client\"><code>MockRestServiceServer</code></a>. Only useful when a single\ncall is made to <a href=\"../../RestTemplateBuilder.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.boot.restclient\"><code>RestTemplateBuilder</code></a> or <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/web/client/RestClient.Builder.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.web.client\"><code>RestClient.Builder</code></a>. If\nmultiple <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/web/client/RestTemplate.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.web.client\"><code>RestTemplates</code></a> or\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/web/client/RestClient.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.web.client\"><code>RestClients</code></a> are in use, inject a\n<a href=\"../MockServerRestTemplateCustomizer.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.boot.restclient.test\"><code>MockServerRestTemplateCustomizer</code></a> and use\n<a href=\"../MockServerRestTemplateCustomizer.html#getServer(org.springframework.web.client.RestTemplate)\"><code>getServer(RestTemplate)</code></a>, or inject a <a href=\"../MockServerRestClientCustomizer.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.boot.restclient.test\"><code>MockServerRestClientCustomizer</code></a> and use\n<a href=\"../MockServerRestClientCustomizer.html#getServer(org.springframework.web.client.RestClient.Builder)\"><code>* getServer(RestClient.Builder)</code></a>, or bind a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/test/web/client/MockRestServiceServer.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.test.web.client\"><code>MockRestServiceServer</code></a> directly.",
      "translation": "可应用于测试类以启用和配置单个 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/test/web/client/MockRestServiceServer.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.test.web.client\"><code>MockRestServiceServer</code></a> 自动配置的注解。仅在向 <a href=\"../../RestTemplateBuilder.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.boot.restclient\"><code>RestTemplateBuilder</code></a> 或 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/web/client/RestClient.Builder.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.web.client\"><code>RestClient.Builder</code></a> 发出单个调用时才有用。如果使用了多个 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/web/client/RestTemplate.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.web.client\"><code>RestTemplates</code></a> 或 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/web/client/RestClient.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.web.client\"><code>RestClients</code></a>，请注入一个 <a href=\"../MockServerRestTemplateCustomizer.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.boot.restclient.test\"><code>MockServerRestTemplateCustomizer</code></a> 并使用 <a href=\"../MockServerRestTemplateCustomizer.html#getServer(org.springframework.web.client.RestTemplate)\"><code>getServer(RestTemplate)</code></a>，或注入一个 <a href=\"../MockServerRestClientCustomizer.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.boot.restclient.test\"><code>MockServerRestClientCustomizer</code></a> 并使用 <a href=\"../MockServerRestClientCustomizer.html#getServer(org.springframework.web.client.RestClient.Builder)\"><code>* getServer(RestClient.Builder)</code></a>，或直接绑定一个 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/test/web/client/MockRestServiceServer.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.test.web.client\"><code>MockRestServiceServer</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "If <a href=\"../MockServerRestTemplateCustomizer.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.boot.restclient.test\"><code>MockServerRestTemplateCustomizer</code></a> and\n<a href=\"../MockServerRestClientCustomizer.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.boot.restclient.test\"><code>MockServerRestClientCustomizer</code></a> should be enabled and\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/test/web/client/MockRestServiceServer.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.test.web.client\"><code>MockRestServiceServer</code></a> beans should be registered. Defaults to <code>true</code>",
      "translation": "如果应启用 <a href=\"../MockServerRestTemplateCustomizer.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.boot.restclient.test\"><code>MockServerRestTemplateCustomizer</code></a> 和 <a href=\"../MockServerRestClientCustomizer.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.boot.restclient.test\"><code>MockServerRestClientCustomizer</code></a>，并且应注册 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/test/web/client/MockRestServiceServer.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.test.web.client\"><code>MockRestServiceServer</code></a>  Bean，则默认为 <code>true</code>`。",
      "count": 2
