    {
      "source": "If <a href=\"../MockServerRestTemplateCustomizer.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.boot.restclient.test\"><code>MockServerRestTemplateCustomizer</code></a> and\n<a href=\"../MockServerRestClientCustomizer.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.boot.restclient.test\"><code>MockServerRestClientCustomizer</code></a> should be enabled and\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/test/web/client/MockRestServiceServer.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.test.web.client\"><code>MockRestServiceServer</code></a> beans should be registered.",
      "translation": "如果应启用 <a href=\"../MockServerRestTemplateCustomizer.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.boot.restclient.test\"><code>MockServerRestTemplateCustomizer</code></a> 和 <a href=\"../MockServerRestClientCustomizer.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.boot.restclient.test\"><code>MockServerRestClientCustomizer</code></a>，并且应注册 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/test/web/client/MockRestServiceServer.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.test.web.client\"><code>MockRestServiceServer</code></a>  Bean。",
